  "created": "2026-10-14T05:02:10.057Z",
  "description": "Thin, generated .NET bindings over a native WebGPU implementation (the wgpu engine) shipped inside the package: every C function as a blittable LibraryImport, every C struct with its exact layout (checked against the native library at load time), enums, bitflags, object handles and callback-info structs - nothing marshalled, nothing hidden. Adds native-device access for Vulkan, Direct3D 12 and Metal (get the backend objects behind a device or texture, wrap existing ones, transition texture states) for sharing a GPU device with other renderers, small sharing contracts so libraries built on it share one device and texture without referencing each other, and the C headers, a generated function table and versioned hand-off structs for native modules (Rust, C, C++) working on the same WebGPU objects. Native libraries for Windows x64 and ARM64, macOS Intel and Apple Silicon, Linux x64, ARM64 and RISC-V 64, and Android 13+ ARM64 and x64.",
